---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import SideContact from '../components/SideContact.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { NAP, AREAS, SERVICES } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title="About CA S. A. Abdul Rahim, Chartered Accountant"
  description="Factual profile of CA S. A. Abdul Rahim, Chartered Accountant in practice in Adyar, Chennai since 1985. Languages, office location and areas of work."
  path="/about/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }]}
>
  <PageHero crumbs={[{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }]} h1={"About CA S. A. Abdul Rahim, Chartered Accountant in Chennai"} lead={"S. A. Abdul Rahim is a Chartered Accountant in practice in Chennai since 1985. The office is at 14/2, 15th Cross Street, Shastri Nagar, Adyar, Chennai, and works in Tamil, English and Hindi."} />
  <div class="wrap layout">
  <article class="prose">

    <h2>Profile</h2>
    <dl class="facts">
      <dt>Name</dt><dd>{NAP.name}</dd>
      <dt>Designation</dt><dd>{NAP.designation}</dd>
      <dt>Professional body</dt><dd>Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI). Under the Chartered Accountants Act, 1949, only members of the ICAI may use the designation Chartered Accountant.</dd>
      <dt>In practice since</dt><dd>12 April 1985</dd>
      <dt>Office</dt><dd>{NAP.addressLine}</dd>
      <dt>Languages</dt><dd>{NAP.languages.join(', ')}</dd>
      <dt>Hours</dt><dd>{NAP.hoursText}</dd>
    </dl>

    <h2>Areas of work</h2>
    <p>The practice covers direct tax, indirect tax, audit and business registrations. In income tax, this includes return filing for individuals, families, businesses and trusts, replies to notices, appeals, capital gains on property and the tax affairs of non-resident Indians. In TDS, it includes TDS on property purchases and quarterly TDS statements. In GST, it includes registration, returns and replies to notices. In audit and accounts, it includes tax audit, statutory audit of companies and monthly bookkeeping. It also covers company, LLP, partnership, trust and Udyam registrations.</p>
    <ul>{SERVICES.map((s) => <li><a href={s.href}>{s.label}</a></li>)}</ul>

    <h2>Office location</h2>
    <p>The office is in Shastri Nagar, Adyar, in South Chennai, near Besant Nagar and Thiruvanmiyur. People visit from {AREAS.slice(0, 10).join(', ')} and other parts of Chennai. Directions are on the <a href="/areas/">areas page</a> and the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

    <h2>About this website</h2>
    <p>This website gives factual information about the practice and general information about tax and compliance topics, as permitted by the guidelines of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India. It does not advertise or solicit work, and it is not professional advice. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
    <p class="meta">Last reviewed: <time datetime="2026-10-29">29 October 2026</time>. Source: <a href="https://www.icai.org/" rel="noopener">Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (icai.org)</a>.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="sidebar"><SideContact /></div>
  </div>
</Base>
